#: src/handlers/admin/command/broadcast.py
msgid "Broadcast mode activated. Use the Back button to cancel at any time."
msgstr "Xabar yuborish rejimi faollashtirildi. Istalgan vaqtda bekor qilish uchun Orqaga tugmasidan foydalaning."

#: src/handlers/admin/message/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Step 1 of 5 — Target languages</b>\n"
"\n"
"Select the languages of the users you want to reach.\n"
"Only users whose interface language matches one of the selected options will "
"receive the broadcast.\n"
"\n"
"You can select multiple languages. Tap a language to toggle it, then press "
"<b>Continue</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>5 bosqichdan 1-bosqich — Maqsadli tillar</b>\n"
"\n"
"Yetib bormoqchi bo'lgan foydalanuvchilar tillarini tanlang.\n"
"Faqat interfeys tili tanlangan variantlardan biriga mos keladigan "
"foydalanuvchilar xabarni oladi.\n"
"\n"
"Siz bir nechta tilni tanlashingiz mumkin. Tilni yoqish yoki o'chirish uchun "
"ustiga bosing, so'ng <b>Davom etish</b> tugmasini bosing."

#: src/handlers/admin/command/broadcast.py:68
#: src/handlers/admin/command/broadcast.py:106
msgid "Please select at least one."
msgstr "Iltimos, kamida bittasini tanlang."

#: src/handlers/admin/message/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Step 3 of 5 — Target chat types</b>\n"
"\n"
"Select which types of chats should receive the broadcast.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Private</b> — direct messages with individual users\n"
"• <b>Group</b> — regular group chats\n"
"• <b>Supergroup</b> — large supergroup chats\n"
"\n"
"Select one or more types, then press <b>Continue</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>5 bosqichdan 3-bosqich — Maqsadli chat turlari</b>\n"
"\n"
"Qaysi turdagi chatlar xabarni qabul qilishini tanlang.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Shaxsiy</b> — alohida foydalanuvchilar bilan to'g'ridan to'g'ri xabarlar\n"
"• <b>Guruh</b> — oddiy guruh chatlari\n"
"• <b>Superguruh</b> — katta superguruh chatlari\n"
"\n"
"Bir yoki bir nechta turni tanlang, so'ng <b>Davom etish</b> tugmasini bosing."

#: src/handlers/admin/message/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Step 4 of 5 — Schedule</b>\n"
"\n"
"Choose when the broadcast should begin.\n"
"\n"
"You can start immediately or delay the send by a few hours.\n"
"The bot will wait the selected amount of time before sending the first "
"message.\n"
"\n"
"Select a start time below."
msgstr ""
"<b>5 bosqichdan 4-bosqich — Rejalashtirish</b>\n"
"\n"
"Xabar yuborish qachon boshlanishini tanlang.\n"
"\n"
"Siz uni darhol boshlashingiz yoki yuborishni bir necha soatga kechiktirishingiz mumkin.\n"
"Birinchi xabarni yuborishdan oldin bot tanlangan vaqt miqdorini kutadi.\n"
"\n"
"Quyidan boshlanish vaqtini tanlang."

#: src/handlers/admin/message/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Step 5 of 5 — Broadcast message</b>\n"
"\n"
"Send the message you want to broadcast to the selected audience.\n"
"\n"
"Supported types: text, photo, video, audio, document, sticker, voice, "
"animation, and more.\n"
"The message will be delivered exactly as you send it.\n"
"\n"
"Send your message now."
msgstr ""
"<b>5 bosqichdan 5-bosqich — Xabar matni</b>\n"
"\n"
"Tanlangan auditoriyaga yubormoqchi bo'lgan xabaringizni yuboring.\n"
"\n"
"Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan turlar: matn, rasm, video, audio, hujjat, stiker, ovozli xabar, "
"animatsiya va boshqalar.\n"
"Xabar aynan siz yuborgan ko'rinishda yetkaziladi.\n"
"\n"
"Xabaringizni hozir yuboring."

#: src/handlers/admin/command/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Send mode</b>\n"
"\n"
"Choose how the message should be delivered to recipients.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Copy</b> — sends the message as a new message. No \"forwarded "
"from\" label is shown.\n"
"• <b>Forward</b> — forwards the original message. Recipients will "
"see the source sender.\n"
"\n"
"Select the desired mode."
msgstr ""
"<b>Yuborish rejimi</b>\n"
"\n"
"Xabar qabul qiluvchilarga qanday yetkazilishini tanlang.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Nusxa</b> — xabarni yangi xabar sifatida yuboradi. \"forwarded "
"from\" belgisi ko'rsatilmaydi.\n"
"• <b>Forward</b> — asl xabarni forward qiladi. Qabul qiluvchilar "
"manba yuboruvchini ko'radi.\n"
"\n"
"Kerakli rejimni tanlang."

#: src/handlers/admin/command/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Broadcast</b>\n"
"\n"
"Audience  —  <b>%(audience)s users</b>\n"
"Mode      —  <b>%(mode)s</b>\n"
"Delay     —  <b>%(delay)s</b>\n"
"\n"
"Confirm to start broadcasting."
msgstr ""
"<b>Xabar yuborish</b>\n"
"\n"
"Auditoriya  —  <b>%(audience)s foydalanuvchi</b>\n"
"Rejim       —  <b>%(mode)s</b>\n"
"Kechikish   —  <b>%(delay)s</b>\n"
"\n"
"Xabar yuborishni boshlashni tasdiqlang."

#: src/handlers/admin/command/broadcast.py
msgid ""
"<b>Broadcast is running</b>\n"
"\n"
"Audience  —  <b>%(audience)s users</b>\n"
"Mode      —  <b>%(mode)s</b>\n"
"Delay     —  <b>%(delay)s</b>\n"
"Datetime  —  <b>%(datetime)s</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Xabar yuborish jarayoni ishlamoqda</b>\n"
"\n"
"Auditoriya  —  <b>%(audience)s foydalanuvchi</b>\n"
"Rejim       —  <b>%(mode)s</b>\n"
"Kechikish   —  <b>%(delay)s</b>\n"
"Sana-vaqt   —  <b>%(datetime)s</b>"

